1
00:00:22,860 --> 00:00:28,120
♪I scaled sheer cliffs for lingzhi,
then found you gathering moonlight♪

2
00:00:28,920 --> 00:00:33,420
♪Two baskets of silver glow
rang out like stone against steel♪

3
00:00:33,810 --> 00:00:37,100
♪You said to cure me of my hesitation♪

4
00:00:37,100 --> 00:00:39,930
♪I'd need nine measures
of wind from the cliffs♪

5
00:00:40,160 --> 00:00:45,280
♪And three measures of a heartbeat
that stops when our eyes meet♪

6
00:00:46,560 --> 00:00:49,900
♪I caught your wrist and said♪

7
00:00:49,900 --> 00:00:54,450
♪This condition is already beyond cure♪

8
00:00:54,460 --> 00:00:56,860
=Hanyi Enters The Heart=

9
00:00:56,860 --> 00:00:59,780
=Episode 23=

10
00:01:16,180 --> 00:01:17,260
(Liu's Apothecary, north of Jinlin Pond
in the southeast corner of Pinren Ward)

11
00:01:20,700 --> 00:01:22,780
(Liu's Apothecary)

12
00:01:31,860 --> 00:01:32,390
Master.

13
00:01:32,790 --> 00:01:34,350
A wealthy businesswoman
recently arrived in the city

14
00:01:34,350 --> 00:01:36,860
and has been spending
generously on medicinal herbs.

15
00:01:37,260 --> 00:01:38,220
I hear her surname is Shen.

16
00:01:42,260 --> 00:01:43,150
You must be

17
00:01:46,900 --> 00:01:47,790
Boss Shen?

18
00:01:50,620 --> 00:01:51,110
That's right.

19
00:01:53,030 --> 00:01:55,500
I've heard so much about you.

20
00:01:56,150 --> 00:01:58,390
I hear you've come from the north

21
00:01:58,430 --> 00:01:59,710
to do some major business.

22
00:02:00,110 --> 00:02:02,390
It's an honor to have you here.

23
00:02:02,510 --> 00:02:05,060
Your visit truly graces my humble shop.

24
00:02:05,620 --> 00:02:06,110
You're too kind.

25
00:02:06,110 --> 00:02:06,830
Come, please have a seat.

26
00:02:07,230 --> 00:02:08,830
Please sit, Boss Shen.

27
00:02:09,420 --> 00:02:10,110
Bring us some tea.

28
00:02:12,060 --> 00:02:13,950
Business is
certainly thriving, Boss Liu.

29
00:02:14,590 --> 00:02:15,900
This shop is quite impressive,

30
00:02:15,980 --> 00:02:17,060
and your storerooms
are filled with medicinal herbs.

31
00:02:17,140 --> 00:02:18,540
Your reputation is well deserved.

32
00:02:19,700 --> 00:02:22,340
You're too kind, Boss Shen.

33
00:02:23,390 --> 00:02:25,950
What exactly are you looking for,

34
00:02:26,260 --> 00:02:27,450
and how much do you need?

35
00:02:31,540 --> 00:02:32,060
Please have some tea.

36
00:02:36,260 --> 00:02:37,060
How much do you need?

37
00:02:38,110 --> 00:02:40,980
Astragalus, angelica, fritillaria,

38
00:02:41,590 --> 00:02:43,110
and several
other medicinal herbs in bulk.

39
00:02:43,310 --> 00:02:45,140
I'll be needing quite a large quantity.

40
00:02:46,870 --> 00:02:48,700
It's just that here in Jiangnan,

41
00:02:49,390 --> 00:02:51,390
the recent price fluctuations
seem rather unusual.

42
00:02:52,590 --> 00:02:56,030
And I hear the Tax Bureau has been
conducting strict inspections lately.

43
00:02:56,870 --> 00:02:58,260
I wonder if you

44
00:02:58,700 --> 00:03:01,180
have the tax receipts and shipping permits
for these bulk transactions,

45
00:03:01,870 --> 00:03:02,870
along with the original records
and account books,

46
00:03:03,140 --> 00:03:04,390
all properly prepared and in order.

47
00:03:06,740 --> 00:03:07,910
As merchants,

48
00:03:08,070 --> 00:03:08,630
we both understand.

49
00:03:09,110 --> 00:03:10,580
We want our businesses
to remain stable in the long run.

50
00:03:10,980 --> 00:03:13,510
I wouldn't want to get caught up
in any questionable dealings.

51
00:03:14,670 --> 00:03:17,510
You're worrying too much, Boss Shen.

52
00:03:17,910 --> 00:03:19,790
Jiangnan is a prosperous region.

53
00:03:20,230 --> 00:03:23,070
Prices naturally follow the market.

54
00:03:23,830 --> 00:03:25,230
The tax receipts and shipping permits

55
00:03:25,390 --> 00:03:27,020
are all in order, of course.

56
00:03:27,460 --> 00:03:29,300
I've always conducted my business

57
00:03:29,630 --> 00:03:31,350
strictly by the rules.

58
00:03:31,540 --> 00:03:33,540
I treat every customer fairly.

59
00:03:34,300 --> 00:03:35,020
Come.

60
00:03:35,260 --> 00:03:36,540
Have some tea.

61
00:03:39,950 --> 00:03:40,630
Boss Shen.

62
00:03:40,700 --> 00:03:43,540
Just focus on inspecting
the goods and discussing the price.

63
00:03:44,230 --> 00:03:45,740
You run
a substantial business, Boss Liu.

64
00:03:45,950 --> 00:03:47,670
I'm sure your rules
are well established.

65
00:03:48,460 --> 00:03:50,860
But this is our first time
doing business together.

66
00:03:51,070 --> 00:03:52,790
It never hurts to be cautious.

67
00:03:53,790 --> 00:03:56,300
If I could see
your warehouse stock for myself

68
00:03:56,980 --> 00:03:58,110
and also examine

69
00:03:58,140 --> 00:03:59,980
your original inventory records
and account books,

70
00:04:00,300 --> 00:04:01,580
I'd feel much more at ease.

71
00:04:03,110 --> 00:04:04,140
Boss Shen.

72
00:04:04,860 --> 00:04:08,230
The warehouse
is restricted, cluttered, and filthy.

73
00:04:08,630 --> 00:04:10,740
I'd hate for you to see such a place.

74
00:04:11,420 --> 00:04:11,950
Besides,

75
00:04:12,260 --> 00:04:13,980
those account books
are terribly tedious.

76
00:04:14,300 --> 00:04:16,190
They'll only give you a headache.

77
00:04:17,830 --> 00:04:18,260
Why don't you

78
00:04:19,020 --> 00:04:21,110
take a look at the samples
in the front hall first?

79
00:04:21,260 --> 00:04:23,140
They're all top quality.

80
00:04:23,670 --> 00:04:25,190
As for the price, we can negotiate.

81
00:04:25,260 --> 00:04:26,260
There's plenty of room for profit.

82
00:04:27,140 --> 00:04:27,580
Boss Liu!

83
00:04:27,860 --> 00:04:28,830
Boss Wang, what's wrong?

84
00:04:28,910 --> 00:04:30,630
There was a problem
with the goods you gave me last time.

85
00:04:30,630 --> 00:04:31,300
All right.

86
00:04:31,300 --> 00:04:32,670
I've already prepared your goods.

87
00:04:32,830 --> 00:04:33,860
Come.

88
00:04:33,910 --> 00:04:34,510
Let's go.

89
00:04:38,580 --> 00:04:39,190
Boss Shen.

90
00:04:39,390 --> 00:04:41,420
Please take a look
at the premium goods first.

91
00:04:42,230 --> 00:04:43,300
I'll be right back.

92
00:04:51,900 --> 00:04:54,340
(Accounting Office,
Authorized Personnel Only)

93
00:05:25,260 --> 00:05:27,060
(Cash Ledger,
Established March, Year Eleven)

94
00:05:33,900 --> 00:05:35,180
(First Day: 400 jin of atractylodes
received by the apothecary)

95
00:05:47,340 --> 00:05:49,140
(Tax Receipt)

96
00:05:56,020 --> 00:05:57,310
Passing off inferior goods
as quality stock,

97
00:05:58,550 --> 00:05:59,660
falsifying losses,

98
00:06:01,390 --> 00:06:02,510
and evading imperial taxes.

99
00:06:03,630 --> 00:06:05,580
These documents
are irrefutable evidence.

100
00:06:10,550 --> 00:06:12,220
What treasure could possibly be hidden

101
00:06:13,060 --> 00:06:14,550
in my filthy accounting office

102
00:06:15,310 --> 00:06:16,340
that would be worth

103
00:06:17,550 --> 00:06:19,260
a personal inspection
from you, Boss Shen?

104
00:06:22,020 --> 00:06:24,310
I'm terribly sorry, Boss Liu.

105
00:06:25,260 --> 00:06:26,510
I urgently needed
to relieve myself just now.

106
00:06:27,070 --> 00:06:29,510
As I was looking around,
I saw this door ajar

107
00:06:29,830 --> 00:06:31,100
and wandered in by mistake.

108
00:06:31,580 --> 00:06:32,460
By mistake?

109
00:06:33,990 --> 00:06:34,950
You needed to relieve yourself?

110
00:06:36,020 --> 00:06:36,780
Boss Shen.

111
00:06:37,900 --> 00:06:40,020
Let's not play games with each other.

112
00:06:41,190 --> 00:06:43,260
Who sent you?

113
00:06:44,310 --> 00:06:46,220
What exactly are you trying to uncover?

114
00:06:49,830 --> 00:06:51,020
Is my wife in there?

115
00:07:06,990 --> 00:07:08,510
Where did you come from?

116
00:07:16,830 --> 00:07:18,220
I'm here to take my wife home.

117
00:07:22,950 --> 00:07:23,900
He's your husband?

118
00:07:26,870 --> 00:07:27,340
My dear.

119
00:07:28,780 --> 00:07:29,630
It's getting late.

120
00:07:30,950 --> 00:07:31,660
It's time to go home.

121
00:07:32,580 --> 00:07:33,310
As for everything else,

122
00:07:34,070 --> 00:07:34,780
we can discuss it another day.

123
00:07:40,550 --> 00:07:42,100
Discuss it another day?

124
00:07:42,780 --> 00:07:45,060
So you want to investigate my accounts.

125
00:08:11,870 --> 00:08:13,870
I watched you take
your last breath with my own eyes.

126
00:08:15,660 --> 00:08:17,020
You were clearly dead.

127
00:08:20,630 --> 00:08:23,660
Yes, that's right.

128
00:08:25,750 --> 00:08:26,900
When you saw me then,

129
00:08:28,340 --> 00:08:29,660
I had indeed stopped breathing.

130
00:08:31,990 --> 00:08:33,510
His Majesty had me
brought back to the palace

131
00:08:34,630 --> 00:08:35,990
and ordered the physicians
to save me at all costs.

132
00:08:37,100 --> 00:08:37,870
They scraped the poisoned bone

133
00:08:38,630 --> 00:08:39,550
and treated my acupoints
with golden needles.

134
00:08:40,390 --> 00:08:42,990
It took me an entire year
to pull back from the brink of death.

135
00:08:44,260 --> 00:08:45,900
His Majesty knew
I had not fully recovered

136
00:08:46,950 --> 00:08:49,260
and was also concerned that Xiao and Cui's
remaining followers had yet to be eliminated.

137
00:08:50,020 --> 00:08:51,310
So he ordered me to remain hidden

138
00:08:52,190 --> 00:08:53,460
and forbade me
from appearing before you.

139
00:08:53,900 --> 00:08:55,310
I could only protect you
from the shadows.

140
00:08:56,580 --> 00:08:57,260
Later, I learned

141
00:08:58,220 --> 00:08:59,310
that you had been ordered
to travel south

142
00:08:59,660 --> 00:09:01,220
to investigate corruption among
Jiangnan officials and imperial relatives.

143
00:09:02,070 --> 00:09:02,950
So I volunteered for the mission.

144
00:09:02,950 --> 00:09:04,310
I accept the decree.

145
00:09:04,340 --> 00:09:06,780
I arrived in Jiangnan months
ahead of you to make preparations.

146
00:09:08,070 --> 00:09:10,900
Liu Xian's connections here run deep.

147
00:09:11,390 --> 00:09:12,510
Gathering evidence has been difficult.

148
00:09:13,750 --> 00:09:15,630
I could only collect evidence of his crimes
piece by piece from the shadows

149
00:09:16,260 --> 00:09:17,100
and quietly secure
the necessary connections,

150
00:09:18,100 --> 00:09:19,870
all to clear the way
for your investigation.

151
00:09:26,580 --> 00:09:28,460
You work in the open,
while I work in the shadows.

152
00:09:29,220 --> 00:09:30,550
That way, I can keep you safe

153
00:09:31,340 --> 00:09:32,500
and help you break the case.

154
00:09:36,010 --> 00:09:38,580
You stand in the light,
upholding justice for all to see.

155
00:09:40,110 --> 00:09:45,500
Then I must remain in the shadows,
quietly keeping you safe.

156
00:09:46,740 --> 00:09:47,980
I could not defy His Majesty's orders.

157
00:09:49,070 --> 00:09:49,830
Li.

158
00:09:52,340 --> 00:09:53,220
Forgive me.

159
00:09:54,670 --> 00:09:55,500
Forgive you?

160
00:09:56,950 --> 00:09:58,030
That's easy for you to say.

161
00:09:59,340 --> 00:10:01,150
Do you know what I've been through
these past three years?

162
00:10:02,740 --> 00:10:03,790
How could you be so cruel?

163
00:10:05,340 --> 00:10:06,220
But all these years,

164
00:10:07,830 --> 00:10:10,190
I've thought of you
every day and every night.

165
00:10:12,910 --> 00:10:13,830
From now on,

166
00:10:14,700 --> 00:10:16,700
I will never hide anything
from you again.

167
00:10:17,340 --> 00:10:18,980
I'll stay by your side day and night,

168
00:10:19,580 --> 00:10:20,460
never leaving you for a moment.

169
00:10:22,500 --> 00:10:24,030
I don't believe a single word you say.

170
00:10:24,910 --> 00:10:25,830
I, Yungui, swear

171
00:10:29,310 --> 00:10:30,340
that no matter what dangers lie ahead,

172
00:10:32,500 --> 00:10:33,580
we will face life and death together.

173
00:10:34,830 --> 00:10:35,860
From this day forward,

174
00:10:38,310 --> 00:10:39,100
we will never part again.

175
00:10:43,340 --> 00:10:44,430
If I break this vow...

176
00:10:45,190 --> 00:10:45,860
Enough.

177
00:11:09,150 --> 00:11:10,430
Useless fools.

178
00:11:10,860 --> 00:11:11,830
The accounting office

179
00:11:13,500 --> 00:11:14,830
is a restricted area.

180
00:11:15,500 --> 00:11:16,790
The weather is dry,

181
00:11:17,150 --> 00:11:18,790
and you let
the accounting office catch fire.

182
00:11:20,030 --> 00:11:21,670
Useless fools.

183
00:11:30,100 --> 00:11:31,740
(Tax Receipt)

184
00:11:33,910 --> 00:11:34,860
These receipts

185
00:11:35,340 --> 00:11:37,340
only show discrepancies in
the amount of astragalus traded.

186
00:11:38,150 --> 00:11:39,550
But the crucial tax amounts

187
00:11:39,700 --> 00:11:40,620
have all been burned away.

188
00:11:41,220 --> 00:11:42,840
Liu Xian dared to burn
the account books in public,

189
00:11:43,220 --> 00:11:45,620
which means the real accounts
must contain something truly damning.

190
00:11:47,380 --> 00:11:48,460
I also noticed just now

191
00:11:49,310 --> 00:11:50,620
that the edges of the tax officer's seal

192
00:11:51,020 --> 00:11:52,550
differ slightly
from the official standard.

193
00:11:53,580 --> 00:11:54,310
That means

194
00:11:55,030 --> 00:11:56,500
this is likely
a counterfeit seal made in secret.

195
00:11:59,400 --> 00:12:00,860
He not only evaded imperial taxes,

196
00:12:01,740 --> 00:12:02,740
but also forged an official seal.

197
00:12:04,380 --> 00:12:06,270
The medicinal reserves
in the government granary...

198
00:12:06,670 --> 00:12:08,100
Probably replaced long ago.

199
00:12:09,550 --> 00:12:10,700
If war

200
00:12:11,150 --> 00:12:11,910
or famine were to strike,

201
00:12:12,580 --> 00:12:14,790
the soldiers and the people
would be given these fake medicines.

202
00:12:18,380 --> 00:12:18,910
So

203
00:12:19,580 --> 00:12:20,830
we must find

204
00:12:20,830 --> 00:12:22,070
the former bookkeeper,
Wang Zhong, as soon as possible.

205
00:12:22,860 --> 00:12:24,340
He managed Liu Xian's
accounts for over twenty years.

206
00:12:25,270 --> 00:12:26,500
Now he's suddenly returned home
for no apparent reason.

207
00:12:26,910 --> 00:12:27,550
That means

208
00:12:28,830 --> 00:12:29,790
they must be hiding

209
00:12:29,830 --> 00:12:30,910
something they don't want
anyone to know.

210
00:12:31,500 --> 00:12:32,430
Liu Xian

211
00:12:32,670 --> 00:12:33,910
has no loyalty to anyone.

212
00:12:34,950 --> 00:12:35,550
By now,

213
00:12:36,310 --> 00:12:37,670
he may have already
sent someone to silence Wang Zhong.

214
00:12:38,310 --> 00:12:38,620
Right.

215
00:12:39,100 --> 00:12:40,380
So we need to get to him first.

216
00:12:41,270 --> 00:12:42,150
There's no time to lose.

217
00:13:00,100 --> 00:13:02,960
♪Every step is hard,
every step fraught with danger♪

218
00:13:03,720 --> 00:13:06,660
♪Every step is a battle with no retreat♪

219
00:13:07,320 --> 00:13:10,140
♪As dawn approaches, those still asleep♪

220
00:13:10,990 --> 00:13:13,980
♪Know nothing
of the bitter cold of the long night♪

221
00:13:14,830 --> 00:13:18,150
♪If fate had not woven its threads
and spurred everything along♪

222
00:13:18,490 --> 00:13:21,780
♪How could we witness life's upheavals
and the passing of time?♪

223
00:13:22,130 --> 00:13:28,610
♪If this grand dream is destined to
be absurd, with no answer to be found♪

224
00:13:29,400 --> 00:13:36,490
♪How I wish that when I wake,
I could still be by your side♪

225
00:13:38,990 --> 00:13:46,840
♪However distant the past,
however far the future♪

226
00:13:47,140 --> 00:13:48,950
♪I stand here today♪

227
00:13:49,090 --> 00:13:53,600
♪Unable to turn back,
with no shore in sight♪

228
00:13:53,600 --> 00:14:01,090
♪Between black and white, once a piece
is placed, there is no regret♪

229
00:14:01,730 --> 00:14:03,020
♪You stepped into the game yourself♪

230
00:14:03,020 --> 00:14:05,420
♪Shielding me from hidden arrows♪

231
00:14:05,860 --> 00:14:12,710
♪Leaving me to a lifetime of solitude♪
